1
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:10,300
=Dungeon Unlocking=

2
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,240
Yesterday,

3
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:14,440
six players were sent back
to the game lobby.

4
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,360
Li Fei returned with them.

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,960
The game designer,
Designer Bai, appeared.

6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,840
He said that Dungeon 4
had another system bug

7
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,560
and needed an urgent fix.

8
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,540
(System maintenance. Players offline)
Re-entry

9
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,560
(Server maintenance. Patching)
was scheduled

10
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,700
(Maintenance complete. Server online)
for 10AM the next day.

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,760
(Server starting soon)
When everyone re-entered,

12
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:32,600
Designer Bai was found dead
inside the pod.

13
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,240
(He is Loading)
He left a message.

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,920
A real-world investigator logged in

15
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,080
and revealed

16
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,200
that the hacker codenamed "Loading"

17
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,520
was hiding among the male players.

18
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,760
From the game records,

19
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,080
they discovered Zhang Ruonan
and Li Fei were beta testers.

20
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:51,320
They had been involved
in the entire game.

21
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,440
Who does the message point to?

22
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:56,700
What is

23
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,480
(Detective Jin Jing)
his true purpose?

24
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,020
(Detective Zhang Ruonan)
Why does the game

25
00:00:59,020 --> 00:00:59,880
(Liu Yuning)
keep having bugs?

26
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,420
(Zhang Linghe)
Can the players

27
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:02,400
(TNT Ding Chengxin)
find the clues

28
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,040
(Zhou Keyu)
and uncover the truth?

29
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:08,480
(Case 9: Escape Door of Truth Loading)
"Door of Truth" game is loading.

30
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:10,060
(All players have logged in)

31
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:11,120
(TNT Ding Chengxin, Liu Yuning, Jin Jing
Zhang Ruonan, Zhang Linghe, Zhou Keyu)

32
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:11,560
(All players have logged in)

33
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:12,700
(Jin Jing, Detective)

34
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:13,660
(Profile: Name: Jin Jing,
Identity: Player)

35
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,500
(Skill Cards:
Compliment Card, Rewind Card)

36
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,160
Too long.

37
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,920
(Maximum emotional value)
We might actually catch feelings.

38
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,500
(When darkness brings us together)
Really.

39
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:20,960
Wait, what...

40
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,680
What are you? A goose?

41
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,040
(Turns into a screaming goose
in the dark)

42
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,240
I think this is so good.

43
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,080
It's so good.

44
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,020
(Good review +1)
So crispy.

45
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,560
This is perfect.

46
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,200
Where can you find a man like this?

47
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,960
The kind of man you marry

48
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:35,240
should be Liu Yuning.

49
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:39,440
I only love my hometown flavor.

50
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,240
You mean fragrant?

51
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,320
Add some sesame.

52
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,320
I swallowed it.

53
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,760
Your teeth are so white.

54
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,320
Thank you.

55
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:47,280
(Justice must be served)
At least let me finish it.

56
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,720
The sauce shouldn't be sweet or salty.

57
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,040
Didn't you say this sauce

58
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,960
(Talk some sense into you)
shouldn't be sweet or salty?

59
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:52,480
We'll eat it ourselves.

60
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,120
(Good things stay in the family)
This is so good.

61
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,960
Amazing.

62
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:54,880
What's wrong?

63
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,240
Hey!

64
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,600
(Don't bully our people)
Who are you bullying?

65
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,240
(Fists of justice)
Sorry.

66
00:01:58,240 --> 00:01:58,840
Sorry.

67
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,600
My mistake.

68
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,400
The key evidence.

69
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,040
The answer is written

70
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,920
(You got caught)
on the riddle.

71
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,480
Should we open this?

72
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,580
(Where did that accent come from?)
Open it.

73
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,750
I deserve my spotlight too.

74
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:10,750
Search.

75
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:13,800
(Can you handle the interrogation?)
Search this place.

76
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,040
Did you notice who was Loading

77
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,200
among us?

78
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,040
Tell me.

79
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,080
You made this fake...

80
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:18,780
(Confidential)

81
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,400
You all know programming.

82
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,680
You deliberately put...

83
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,680
(Confidential)

84
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,080
so others would see it.

85
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,520
Including this...

86
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,080
(Confidential)

87
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,240
We planted all of this on purpose.

88
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,640
To trap the seven of us forever

89
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,840
inside this game.

90
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:32,200
We're all about to die in real life.

91
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,800
You created...

92
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:34,660
(Confidential)

93
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:36,680
Because you found all these clues.

94
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:37,920
I got it.

95
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,240
It's one of the two.

96
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:39,800
Let me ask you.

97
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,200
What is the thing
you fear the most in your life?

98
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,040
Answer honestly.

99
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,800
Only the killer can lie.

100
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,860
(Can Jin Jing identify the killer?)

101
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:47,980
(Zhang Ruonan, Detective)

102
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:48,980
(Profile: Name: Zhang Ruonan,
Identity: Player)

103
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:49,900
(Skill Card: Summon Card)

104
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,560
(She can handle everything)
I'm going to break the door.

105
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,400
What does it look like?

106
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,400
(Curious)
What does it look like? Let me see.

107
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,140
It's so good.

108
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:54,840
(Good review)

109
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,560
(Considerate)
Wear a glove. Don't burn yourself.

110
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,320
Can you even hear yourself clearly?

111
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,000
Our attitude is pretty good.

112
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,000
(Curious)
Can we go down and play here?

113
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,840
I'll go first.

114
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,880
I'm light, I...

115
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,100
Handsome.

116
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,280
(Too handsome)

117
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,720
(Start the chant)
For your health, no sneaking snacks.

118
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:12,140
Back to where it all began.

119
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:13,040
(Instant jump)

120
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,280
(I'll lead the way)
I'll go ahead.

121
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:14,840
Really?

122
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,720
Let me feel it.

123
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,440
Anyone there?

124
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:18,540
(Wave)

125
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,960
Who is doing this tiny shuffle?

126
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,200
Me, because I'm walking backward.

127
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,260
(Shuffle)

128
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:25,880
Twenty-eight.

129
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,780
(Focused on the mission)

130
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,880
Twenty-nine.

131
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,440
Ma'am, you've worked hard.

132
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,280
Sorry to trouble you.

133
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,480
I want it to be simple.

134
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,040
Nothing too complicated.

135
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,840
I have to take responsibility for this.

136
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,280
(Every detail matters. No escape from Nan
Detective Nan focuses on collecting evidence)

137
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,280
This is someone else's place.

138
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,320
You can't just start searching.

139
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,720
He hit a bug too.

140
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,320
This was discovered in February.

141
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:44,960
Wasn't there something

142
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,720
drawn on his arm?

143
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:46,680
This crossbow is his...

144
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,580
(Confidential)

145
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,360
One on top,

146
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,680
one below.

147
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,240
Could he be a...

148
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,060
(Confidential)

149
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:53,880
He just mentioned

150
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,560
777 Happiness Road.

151
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,280
What was 1111 for again?

152
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,440
Could this be...

153
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,180
(Confidential)

154
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,080
This person might be...

155
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,300
(Confidential)

156
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:03,760
(Confidential)

157
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,400
... wanted to make this game his own.

158
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,840
When he came in,

159
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,240
when he was making adjustments,

160
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,880
that's when he was killed.

161
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,080
Are you afraid of being alone?

162
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,320
That...

163
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:11,840
(Confidential)

164
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,440
afraid...

165
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,000
(Confidential)

166
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,520
of bumping into something.

167
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,880
You can't just stay silent.

168
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,900
(Can Zhang Ruonan get key information?)

169
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:18,140
(Liu Yuning)

170
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,060
(Profile: Name: Liu Yuning,
Identity: Player)

171
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:19,940
(Skill Card: Compliment Card)

172
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,480
(Welcome! Food and fun included)
We'll shout at him.

173
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,070
Okay.

174
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,360
(A counterattack)

175
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,600
Use the truth to talk back.

176
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,520
Let me do it.

177
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,080
Can you?

178
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:27,520
I can.

179
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,920
Really, Ning?

180
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,400
Ning, you're amazing.

181
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:31,960
Okay.

182
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,940
(Group watching)

183
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,920
What do you want to eat?
I'll make it for you.

184
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,040
Don't add too much scallion.

185
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,260
(Accent goes wrong)
Keep it less.

186
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:40,060
(He is good at everything)

187
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,220
(Let's get moving)

188
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:46,960
Are you sure?

189
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,240
I've already forgotten your parents.

190
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,320
Eight hundred soldiers

191
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,880
rush toward the north slope.

192
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,520
The Longdong Army is back!

193
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,020
(Fired up)
Longdong Army!

194
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,000
Longdong Army!

195
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,640
Maybe all the bugs

196
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,560
in our world

197
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,320
(The truth can't hide)
were actually his plan.

198
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,680
He was killed when he teleported here.

199
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:03,880
At that moment,

200
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,680
we heard the teleport pod had arrived.

201
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,840
That means besides the seven of us.

202
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,280
Someone else came.

203
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,240
Another person came.

204
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,520
He can fully immerse himself in it.

205
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,440
This area can't bring...

206
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:13,840
(Confidential)

207
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,360
... in.

208
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:14,880
(Confidential)

209
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,240
He used this item.

210
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:19,400
Maybe the weapon
was placed there beforehand,

211
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,160
and he made...

212
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,480
(Confidential)
to make it look like he was there.

213
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,400
Certain injuries

214
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,640
caused complications.

215
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,600
But they aren't fatal.

216
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,720
That's the key point.

217
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,960
(Confidential)

218
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,720
Every item is fixed in place.

219
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,480
This is solid proof.

220
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:33,240
There's one possibility...

221
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,960
(Confidential)

222
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,040
One of the five of us

223
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,920
kept their memories

224
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,800
If I were the killer,

225
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:41,480
why would I film that myself?

226
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:44,320
I wouldn't expose

227
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,160
where I live.

228
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:48,500
(Can Liu Yuning clear his suspicion?)

229
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:49,660
(Zhang Linghe)

230
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,500
(Profile: Name: Zhang Linghe,
Identity: Player)

231
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:51,500
(Skill Card: Item Card, Copy Card,
Free Card, Singing Card, Freeze Card)

232
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,460
(Instant Eating, Full of Energy)
Grab some

233
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,360
(Craving Satisfied)
food and drinks.

234
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:55,720
It won't help.

235
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,360
I just wrote a note

236
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,400
asking him to send me some food.

237
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:57,960
But he hasn't sent it.

238
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,890
(Want a bite)
This looks so delicious.

239
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,720
It's almost burnt.

240
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,840
Come get some.

241
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:02,920
I really love this.

242
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,720
But shouldn't we mix it first?

243
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,800
I love eating it plain too.

244
00:06:07,020 --> 00:06:07,740
(Relieving the craving)

245
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:09,180
(Can't stop)

246
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:10,860
(Sharing time)

247
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:12,460
(Let me try)

248
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:13,300
(Package still sealed)

249
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,320
What if he finds out

250
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,360
I ate it?

251
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,040
Pay first. Pay first.

252
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,040
You still have to pay anyway.

253
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,880
Do you know where I'm from?

254
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,320
(Keep it a secret)
I'm from the "Iron Fist Bureau."

255
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,480
He's just too cool.

256
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,360
A Tyrannosaurus Rex.

257
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,280
You two did solo missions.

258
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,580
(Dazed JPG)

259
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,760
Let's go, guys.

260
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:31,920
Let's go!

261
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,320
Let's go.

262
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:35,300
(Celebrate a little)

263
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:37,760
That means the place where he died

264
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,040
wasn't the crime scene.

265
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,000
(Ling carries the team)

266
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,920
(Confidential)
He used it to drag him in.

267
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:43,120
He provided you
with a private rest area.

268
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,680
Yet you took him out.

269
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,360
That means the four of us
might not even know

270
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,680
that we are Loading right now.

271
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,120
It's very possible that we...

272
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,760
(Confidential)

273
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,320
So the weapon isn't...

274
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,480
(Confidential)

275
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,760
He said something important.

276
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,080
My memory only goes back to today.

277
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,360
All those things in your house are...

278
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,240
(Confidential)

279
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,160
