(Good dad becomes fierce dad)

560
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,120
You admit it, right?

561
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,520
Sure.

562
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,280
(I'm giving it my all to win)

563
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:31,800
What is this?

564
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,500
(Dialect word: Yan dao)
Yan dao.

565
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:35,300
(Blank eyes)

566
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:37,240
The literal meaning
definitely isn't this.

567
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,280
Yan dao.

568
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,520
(Muttering)
Yan dao.

569
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,400
Yan dao.

570
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
You're such a little troublemaker.

571
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,160
(Interpreting)
It should mean this, right?

572
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,400
A troublemaker
or someone quirky and playful.

573
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,650
(Making a sentence)
Ding, you're such a little "yan dao".

574
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:51,800
Not bad, right?

575
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,760
A little "yan dao", right?

576
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:54,920
(Asking)

577
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,640
Yan dao means handsome.

578
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,760
(Meaning: Yan dao means handsome)
You're such a handsome guy.

579
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,400
That's right.

580
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,720
You're the handsome one.

581
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:01,180
(Guessing wrong, but the sentence works)
It works.

582
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,520
The last one is...

583
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,280
Bao li bao qi.

584
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,860
(Dialect word: bao li bao qi)
Bao li bao qi.

585
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,120
This one...

586
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,600
Only Zhou Keyu is left.

587
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,650
(Making a sentence)
In my heart,

588
00:14:12,650 --> 00:14:15,110
Zhou Keyu is definitely
not a "bao li bao qi" person.

589
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,320
It means silly.

590
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,200
Silly.

591
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,240
(Meaning: bao li bao qi means silly)

592
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:19,720
That works too.

593
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,560
It sounds natural.

594
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:21,600
He's definitely not silly.

595
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,360
He's extremely smart.

596
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:22,680
Okay.

597
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:24,500
(Liu Yuning completed the challenge)
They all work now.

598
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:29,640
Okay, I'll give you one.

599
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,560
Hao ba pao.

600
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,760
(Dialect word)

601
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,040
Hou zaan gwai.

602
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:36,680
Jian lou zi.

603
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,640
Bao li bao qi.

604
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,200
Ying zha.

605
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,400
And cheng peng.

606
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:46,930
(Making a sentence)
I think Zhang Linghe is "bao li bao qi".

607
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:47,760
That works, right?

608
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:51,470
(Making a sentence)
Ding Chengxin handles "jian lou zi".

609
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:56,400
Don't be fooled by Liu Yuning...

610
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,160
Liu Yuning...

611
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:57,940
(Slipped up)

612
00:14:57,940 --> 00:15:00,650
(Making a sentence)
Liu Yuning isn't just "ying zha".

613
00:15:00,650 --> 00:15:02,580
Actually, he's pretty "ying zha".

614
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,560
(Sudden realization)
Do I need to explain what they mean?

615
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,400
Do you know?

616
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:06,920
I know some of them.

617
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,560
(Searching dialects...)
Bao li bao qi means

618
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,040
the opposite

619
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:10,920
of dripping in jewels.

620
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,520
(Bao li bao qi: goofy)

621
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,920
It means goofy.

622
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,200
(I know this)
I think jian lou zi means...

623
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:19,440
(Jian lou zi: scoring an easy bargain)
always scoring a bargain.

624
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,640
Always showing up
at the right time.

625
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,200
Like always scoring a free meal.

626
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,200
(Dialect pro)
Jian lou zi.

627
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,280
Ying zha?

628
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,460
I think it means...

629
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:27,160
(Ying zha: impressive)
Liu Yuning is pretty stubborn.

630
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,160
(Great at arguing back)
He's a ying zha.

631
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,920
Hao ba pao.

632
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:31,920
I think I'm pretty hao ba pao.

633
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:33,320
(Hao ba pao: awesome)
I feel like it means easily fired up.

634
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,880
(Wrong, but convincing)
Like someone easy to use.

635
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:35,560
(Moving on)

636
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:36,520
Hou zaan gwai.

637
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:39,200
I think Ding Chengxin
is really hou zaan gwai.

638
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,760
(Hou zaan gwai: cute, playful)
Zhou Keyu is kind of hou zaan gwai, too.

639
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,920
(Close enough)
Like clever and playful.

640
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,240
(Nailed it)
Cheng peng? I think...

641
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:48,020
(Sentence)
Zhang Ruonan is very cheng peng.

642
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,520
(Cheng peng: supportive. Close enough)
Maybe it means loyal.

643
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:51,180
(Waiting...)

644
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,500
(Speedrun cleared)
Did she get it?

645
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:53,360
(Jin Jing completes the challenge)
You did. Congrats!

646
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:53,840
I passed.

647
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:56,760
Okay, draw six.

648
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,360
(Dialect phrase: Lek lek ju)
Le Le Zhu.

649
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:00,040
Le Le Jer?

650
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,240
Le Le Zhu?

651
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,280
Which dialect?

652
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,480
Cantonese.

653
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,840
Le le ju?

654
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:11,080
Lek lek ju?

655
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,280
Lek lek ju.

656
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:13,440
(Brain freeze)

657
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,320
What do you think it means?

658
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,320
I'll skip that one.

659
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,560
Next one.

660
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,440
Er bu ba.

661
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,280
Which dialect?

662
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:19,980
(Dialect phrase: Er bu ba)

663
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,000
Hokkien?

664
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:23,840
Er bu ba.

665
00:16:23,940 --> 00:16:25,460
(Saving that one)

666
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,040
Ba dou yao.

667
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,570
(Dialect phrase: Ba dou yao)
Ba dou yao?

668
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,040
It's Hokkien, too?

669
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,040
(Dialect phrase: Hua hu lan)
Hua hu lan.

670
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,560
Yan dao.

671
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:34,240
Gou zui.

672
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:35,440
All are Hokkien.

673
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,960
(Hokkien magnet)
Did I only draw Hokkien?

674
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,520
Born a southerner. Can't help it.

675
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,960
Pick a name? Then, I pick Jin.

676
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:42,560
Jin Jing.

677
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:46,460
(No clue)

678
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,480
I have no clue.

679
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,280
I know none of these.

680
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,800
Ba dou yao.

681
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,050
(Sentence)
The gou zui, yan dao Jin Jing

682
00:16:55,420 --> 00:16:57,490
was ba dou yao

683
00:16:57,490 --> 00:16:59,300
(Rapid-fire sentence)
and said er bu ba,

684
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:00,900
hua hu lan, and lek lek ju.

685
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:02,820
(Making his own rules)

686
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,110
What does that sentence mean?

687
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,310
You think I can?

688
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:06,880
Think about it.

689
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,560
(Combining them was impressive)
What were you trying to say?

690
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:09,830
Jin...

691
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:13,340
(Brain in overdrive)

692
00:17:13,730 --> 00:17:16,490
(Sentence: The gou zui, yan dao Jin Jing)
The kind and pretty Jin Jing

693
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:21,600
(was ba dou yao and said er bu ba)
was in a Suzhou garden

694
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,180
(hua hu lan, and lek lek ju)
and gave me a gold necklace.

695
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:24,740
(Dreaming big)

696
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,520
What it actually means

697
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,840
(Gou zui: cute; Yan dao: handsome)
is the handsome and adorable Jin Jing

698
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:32,890
(Ba dou yao: hungry)
was hungry

699
00:17:32,890 --> 00:17:36,040
(Er bu ba: amazing)
and said, "You're amazing."

700
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,580
(Hua hu lan: ignore the nonsense)
"I'm not listening to that nonsense,"

701
00:17:37,580 --> 00:17:39,060
(Lek lek ju: smart little cutie)
"you smart little cutie."

702
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,600
So, the handsome and adorable Jin Jing

703
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:43,280
(Making it work)

704
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:46,960
is amazing at being hungry,

705
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:49,960
and tells the smart little cutie

706
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,880
to stop talking nonsense.

707
00:17:51,740 --> 00:17:53,540
(He approves)
Sure. That works.

708
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:54,720
(Zhang Linghe completes the challenge)

709
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,120
I passed.

710
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,760
One, two, three, four, five, six.

711
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,440
All set.

712
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,340
(Dialect phrase)
Er bu ba.

713
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:01,700
Qia bei bei.

714
00:18:03,170 --> 00:18:04,180
Yan dao.

715
00:18:04,430 --> 00:18:05,290
Gou zui.

716
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:07,560
Ba yao dou.

717
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:09,410
Ba dou yao.

718
00:18:09,890 --> 00:18:10,800
Hua hu lan.

719
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:17,300
(Sentence)
Liu Yuning slurped noodles, all gou zui.

720
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,320
Gou zui?

721
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,280
(Imagination running wild)

722
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,320
Kissing?

723
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:20,840
No.

724
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:22,000
In Hokkien,

725
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,000
it means cute.

726
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:26,080
That still works.

727
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:26,840
Sure.

728
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,040
He slurped noodles,

729
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:28,840
(A very steady save)
all gou zui.

730
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,280
Okay.

731
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:32,320
What does yan dao mean?

732
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,280
(Next hurdle)

733
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,080
Yan dao...

734
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,840
(Sentence)
I saw someone yan dao into the lake,

735
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,300
(Clueless, but committed)
so I threw them a life preserver

736
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:41,220
and pulled them out.

737
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:43,740
(That should work)

738
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:46,560
So, yan dao means drowning?

739
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:47,840
Going under.

740
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,280
In Hokkien, it means handsome.

741
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:50,880
Handsome.

742
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:51,840
Ding Chengxin...

743
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,280
(Another smooth save)
Right. I fell in handsomely.

744
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,960
Okay, that works.

745
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:56,960
Ba dou yao?

746
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:58,040
What's ba dou yao?

747
00:18:58,560 --> 00:18:59,280
Ba dou yao.

748
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,320
Ba dou yao.

749
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:05,310
(Sentence)
Zhang Ruonan is extremely ba dou yao.

750
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,000
(His interpretation)
Maybe glamorous?

751
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,080
It means hungry.

752
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,320
Extremely hungry?

753
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,840
(Still unfazed)
That works. Okay.

754
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:14,320
Qia bei bei.

755
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:15,920
Er bu ba, qia bei bei.

756
00:19:17,390 --> 00:19:20,180
(Sentence)
Jin Jing's being qia bei bei. So cozy.

757
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,960
Maybe it means hugging a baby.

758
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,000
It means fierce.

759
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:24,920
Fierce?

760
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:25,160
Right.

761
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:28,400
Jin Jing's being fierce
in the room. So cozy.

762
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:29,880
Honestly...

763
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:33,920
it shows a full range of emotion.

764
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:36,120
(Ding's defense)
It makes her feel real.

765
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,160
And somehow warm.

766
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,160
Linghe...

767
00:19:41,130 --> 00:19:43,310
(Sentence)
Zhang Linghe dragged an er bu ba around.

768
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,120
Maybe er bu ba means

769
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:48,120
walking or dancing.

770
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:48,920
It means

771
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,560
someone is really good.

772
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:53,920
Zhang Linghe was great in the plaza.

773
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,680
That's true.

774
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:56,320
Because he can really dance.

775
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:57,640
(Me?)
So he's great at plaza dancing.

776
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,960
He's great at plaza dancing.

777
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:00,900
(Solid save)
He's amazing.

778
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:02,640
Okay.

779
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:04,160
Okay. Zhou Keyu, hua hu lan.

780
00:20:04,580 --> 00:20:06,100
(Brain fried)

781
00:20:06,630 --> 00:20:09,280
(Sentence)
Zhou Keyu hua hu lan every morning

782
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:12,100
because he knows exactly what he wants.

783
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,360
What's hua hu lan?

784
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,880
It means, "I'm ignoring your nonsense."

785
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,920
Every morning, Zhou Keyu

786
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,400
(Let me rephrase)
tells himself

787
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,800
to ignore other people's nonsense

788
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,160
and trust himself.

789
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,360
Close enough. Okay.

790
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:27,180
(Ding Chengxin completes the challenge)
Impressive.

791
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:31,320
(Dialect phrase: Hao ba pao)
Okay. Hao ba pao and Zhang Ruonan.

792
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,360
Nice.

793
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:34,060
(This one's tough)

794
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:35,880
Hao ba pao.

795
00:20:36,340 --> 00:20:38,460
(Thinking...)

796
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,840
What does hao ba pao mean?

797
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:41,920
Hao ba pao?

798
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,740
(Help me out)

799
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:45,400
I can only guess.

800
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,680
Since "hao" means good,

801
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:51,720
I should probably say something nice

802
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:52,920
about Zhang Ruonan.

803
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:56,790
(Sentence)
Zhang Ruonan is gorgeous,

804
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:58,840
as beautiful as a hao ba pao.

805
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,600
(Close enough?)
Does that work?

806
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:03,080
I don't know what it means,

807
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:03,920
but it looks

808
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:06,720
like a compliment.

809
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:08,800
So I used it that way.

810
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:11,360
Hao ba pao is Cantonese.

811
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:11,960
Hou...

812
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:12,700
(Cantonese)

813
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:13,960
Ba pao.

814
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,640
Nosy woman?

815
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,940
(No way...)

816
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:19,360
You scared me!

817
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:20,400
I thought my career

818
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,400
was over.

819
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:22,360
That's not it.

820
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:23,640
(Nearly panicked)
Wait, everyone.

821
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,320
Hold on.

822
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:26,840
Hao ba pao... Hou ba pao...

823
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:28,320
I don't know either.

824
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:29,760
I have no idea.

825
00:21:29,760 --> 00:21:31,280
